WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.300
[Soft background music]

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.300
It all starts here…

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.300
Can you hear that?

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.300
We have to go now.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.300
Don't look back.

6
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.300
I knew you would come.

7
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.300
Look!

8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.300
This is our last chance.

9
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.300
Trust me.

10
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.300
What just happened?

11
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.300
It's far from over.

12
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.300
[Waves crashing]

13
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.300
Let's go home.

14
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.300
See you again.

15
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.300
Nobody knows that.
